From: Androlinzberg maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] Watchdog: retain stock monitoring through the host session boundary

The hosted session provides process discovery, DropBox reports and failure
recovery. Keep stock HandlerChecker ordering, timeout states, controller and
debugger decisions. HIDL and host-kernel reset are outside this process graph.

--- a/services/core/java/com/android/server/Watchdog.java
+++ b/services/core/java/com/android/server/Watchdog.java
@@ -27,7 +27,6 @@
